  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "Try to write the number two thousand and five without using a zero. It is surprisingly difficult. Yet for most of human history, people counted, traded, and built great cities without any symbol for \"nothing.\" Zero had to be invented.",
      "ja": "2005という数を、ゼロを使わずに書いてみよう。意外とむずかしい。しかし人類の歴史の大部分で、人びとは「何もない」を表す記号なしで数え、取引し、大きな都市を築いた。ゼロは発明される必要があったのだ。",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "room",
        "items": [
          {
            "e": "🔢",
            "x": 22,
            "y": 50,
            "s": 3
          },
          {
