            "e": "🖐️",
            "x": 76,
            "y": 50,
            "s": 3
          },
          {
            "e": "✏️",
            "x": 85,
            "y": 75,
            "s": 2
          },
          {
            "e": "🤔",
            "x": 15,
            "y": 78,
            "s": 2.5
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ancient Romans, for example, wrote numbers with letters such as V, X, and C. Their system had no zero at all. It worked for recording amounts, but it was not efficient for calculation. Multiplying large numbers was a job for specialists.",
      "ja": "たとえば古代ローマ人は、V、X、Cなどの文字で数を書いた。その方式にはゼロがまったくなかった。量を記録するには使えたが、計算には効率的でなかった。大きな数のかけ算は専門家の仕事だった。",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "city",
        "items": [
          {
            "e": "🏛️",
            "x": 50,
            "y": 55,
            "s": 4.5
          },
