            "e": "🧮",
            "x": 78,
            "y": 72,
            "s": 2.5
          },
          {
            "e": "😵",
            "x": 25,
            "y": 50,
            "s": 1.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 2,300 years ago, writers in Babylon took a first step. In their system, the position of a symbol changed its value, so they needed to mark an empty position. They used two small marks as a sign for \"nothing here.\"",
      "ja": "およそ2300年前、バビロンの書記たちが最初の一歩をふみだした。彼らの方式では記号の位置で値が変わるので、空の位置に印をつける必要があった。そこで小さな二つの印を「ここには何もない」のしるしに使った。",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "desert",
        "items": [
          {
            "e": "🧱",
            "x": 50,
            "y": 65,
            "s": 4.5
          },
          {
            "e": "✍️",
            "x": 30,
            "y": 62,
            "s": 2.5
