            "a": "sway"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This was a bold idea. How can \"nothing\" be \"something\"? Many thinkers found the question uncomfortable. But Indian mathematicians cared about results, and the evidence was clear: with zero and nine other symbols, any number could be written and calculated quickly.",
      "ja": "これは大胆な考えだった。「無」がどうして「何か」になれるのか。多くの思想家はこの問いを不快に感じた。しかしインドの数学者は結果を重んじ、証拠は明らかだった。ゼロとほかの9つの記号で、どんな数もすばやく書いて計算できたのだ。",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "garden",
        "items": [
          {
            "e": "🤔",
            "x": 22,
            "y": 70,
            "s": 3.2
